      "html_content": "<!--\n  12 Volt Power - Welcome series, email 4 of 6\n  Timing: 3 days after email 3 (day 7).\n  Flow filters: can receive email marketing; has not placed an order since starting the flow.\n  Goal: differentiate 12VP from generalist electrical suppliers by explaining the professional-grade-only stocking policy and the brands carried.\n  Subject line options:\n    A: Why we don't carry hobby-grade parts | Preview: The brands behind everything we sell.\n    B: We turn down cheaper inventory on purpose | Preview: Here's why that matters for your build.\n    C: The brands we stock, and why | Preview: Victron, Blue Sea, Anderson, Scanstrut, and more.\n-->\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" xmlns:o=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\">\n  <meta name=\"x-apple-disable-message-reformatting\">\n  <title>12 Volt Power</title>\n  <!--[if mso]>\n  <noscript><xml><o:OfficeDocumentSettings><o:PixelsPerInch>96</o:PixelsPerInch></o:OfficeDocumentSettings></xml></noscript>\n  <![endif]-->\n  <style>\n    @media screen and (max-width: 600px) {\n      .container { width: 100% !important; }\n      .stack { display: block !important; width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; }\n      .p-24 { padding-left: 20px !important; padding-right: 20px !important; }\n      .feature-col { display: block !important; width: 100% !important; }\n      .h1 { font-size: 26px !important; line-height: 32px !important; }\n      .prodimg { width: 100% !important; max-width: 100% !important; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#e9e9e9; -webkit-text-size-adjust:100%; -ms-text-size-adjust:100%;\">\n\n  <div style=\"display:none; max-height:0; overflow:hidden; mso-hide:all;\">\n    The brands behind everything we sell, and why we won't carry anything else.\n  </div>\n\n  <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"background-color:#e9e9e9;\">\n    <tr>\n      <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 12px;\">\n\n        <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>\n        <table width=\"600\" align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr><td>\n        <![endif]-->\n        <table role=\"presentation\" class=\"container\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"max-width:600px; background-color:#ffffff;\">\n\n          <!-- Header -->\n          <tr>\n            <td align=\"center\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff; padding:26px 24px 22px 24px; border-bottom:3px solid #b71f23;\">\n              <a href=\"https://www.12voltpower.com/\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/WkjQnY/images/2713dac1-7741-4156-ad92-ec6de534b73a.png\" width=\"210\" alt=\"12 Volt Power\" style=\"display:block; margin:0 auto; width:210px; max-width:210px; height:auto; border:0;\"></a>\n              <p style=\"margin:12px 0 0 0; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:11px; letter-spacing:2px; text-transform:uppercase; color:#7c7c7c;\">Powering &amp; Connecting the World</p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Intro -->\n          <tr>\n            <td align=\"left\" class=\"p-24\" style=\"background:#000000; background:linear-gradient(135deg,#000000 0%,#a91d20 100%); padding:40px 36px;\">\n              <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:2px; text-transform:uppercase; color:#f0b8b9;\">Why professional-grade</p>\n              <h1 class=\"h1\" style=\"margin:0 0 14px 0; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:30px; line-height:36px; font-weight:bold; color:#ffffff;\">We turn down cheaper inventory on purpose</h1>\n              <p style=\"margin:0; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:24px; color:#f1d4d5;\">A part that fails at the wrong moment costs more than the part itself.</p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Body copy -->\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"p-24\" style=\"padding:28px 36px 8px 36px; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:15px; line-height:23px; color:#1a1a1a;\">\n              Plenty of suppliers carry consumer and professional parts side by side, then leave you to sort out which is which. We don't. Every brand on our shelves is one we'd trust in a boat, RV, off-grid system, radio setup, work truck, or emergency vehicle that has to run when it matters.\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Brands feature boxes 2x2 grid -->\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"p-24\" style=\"padding:22px 28px 8px 28px;\">\n              <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td class=\"feature-col\" width=\"50%\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0 8px 12px 0;\">\n                    <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\n                      <tr>\n                        <td style=\"background-color:#f5f5f5; padding:20px 18px;\">\n                          <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-weight:bold; color:#000000;\">Victron Energy</p>\n                          <p style=\"margin:0; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:13px; line-height:20px; color:#3a3a3a;\">Inverters, monitoring, and off-grid power systems.</p>\n                        </td>\n                      </tr>\n                    </table>\n                  </td>\n                  <td class=\"feature-col\" width=\"50%\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0 0 12px 8px;\">\n                    <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\n                      <tr>\n                        <td style=\"background-color:#f5f5f5; padding:20px 18px;\">\n                          <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-weight:bold; color:#000000;\">Blue Sea Systems</p>\n                          <p style=\"margin:0; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:13px; line-height:20px; color:#3a3a3a;\">Fuse blocks, busbars, and circuit protection built to last.</p>\n                        </td>\n                      </tr>\n                    </table>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                  <td class=\"feature-col\" width=\"50%\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0 8px 0 0;\">\n                    <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\n                      <tr>\n                        <td style=\"background-color:#f5f5f5; padding:20px 18px;\">\n                          <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-weight:bold; color:#000000;\">Anderson Power Products</p>\n                          <p style=\"margin:0; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:13px; line-height:20px; color:#3a3a3a;\">Powerpole connectors trusted across mobile, marine, radio, and professional installs.</p>\n                        </td>\n                      </tr>\n                    </table>\n                  </td>\n                  <td class=\"feature-col\" width=\"50%\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0 0 0 8px;\">\n                    <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\n                      <tr>\n                        <td style=\"background-color:#f5f5f5; padding:20px 18px;\">\n                          <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-weight:bold; color:#000000;\">Scanstrut</p>\n                          <p style=\"margin:0; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:13px; line-height:20px; color:#3a3a3a;\">Marine-grade cable seals and mounting hardware.</p>\n                        </td>\n                      </tr>\n                    </table>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Body copy 2 -->\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"p-24\" style=\"padding:22px 36px 8px 36px; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:15px; line-height:23px; color:#1a1a1a;\">\n              We also carry ProMariner, Mastervolt, Xantrex, and Samlex — the same reasoning applies to every brand on the list. If it's not built for professional use, it doesn't make the shelf.\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- CTA -->\n          <tr>\n            <td align=\"center\" class=\"p-24\" style=\"padding:22px 36px 22px 36px;\">\n              <!--[if mso]>\n              <v:roundrect xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" xmlns:w=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word\"\n                href=\"https://www.12voltpower.com/brands/\" style=\"height:48px;v-text-anchor:middle;width:220px;\" arcsize=\"8%\"\n                strokecolor=\"#b71f23\" fillcolor=\"#b71f23\">\n                <w:anchorlock/>\n                <center style=\"color:#ffffff;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;\">Shop by brand</center>\n              </v:roundrect>\n              <![endif]-->\n              <!--[if !mso]><!-->\n              <a href=\"https://www.12voltpower.com/brands/\" style=\"background-color:#b71f23; border-radius:4px; color:#ffffff; display:inline-block; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:15px; font-weight:bold; line-height:48px; text-align:center; text-decoration:none; width:220px; -webkit-text-size-adjust:none;\">Shop by brand</a>\n              <!--<![endif]-->\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Help line -->\n          <tr>\n            <td align=\"center\" class=\"p-24\" style=\"padding:0 36px 34px 36px; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:21px; color:#3a3a3a;\">\n              Need help matching a brand to your build? Call <a href=\"tel:+18009622611\" style=\"color:#b71f23; font-weight:bold; text-decoration:none;\">(800) 962-2611</a>, Mon to Fri, 8AM to 4PM PST.\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Footer -->\n          <tr>\n            <td align=\"center\" style=\"background-color:#000000; padding:28px 36px; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px; line-height:18px; color:#9a9a9a;\">\n              <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#ffffff; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:1px;\">12 VOLT POWER</p>\n              <p style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;\">{{ organization.name }}<br>{{ organization.full_address }}</p>\n              <p style=\"margin:0;\"><a href=\"{% unsubscribe_link %}\" style=\"color:#9a9a9a; text-decoration:underline;\">Unsubscribe</a></p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n        </table>\n        <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>\n        </td></tr></table>\n        <![endif]-->\n\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n",
